      247.25,
      401.91,
      269.75
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      280.85,
      401.89,
      303.35
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Evidence (Amendment)Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.45,
      401.92,
      370.55
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 6 of the Evidence Ordinance (Chapter 14)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in the illustration (b) to that section, by thesubstitution for the words, \u201cwaging war against the Queen.\u201dof the words, \u201cwaging war against the Republic\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      381.65,
      401.88,
      437.75
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 10 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in the illustration to that section, by the substitutionfor the words, \u201c \u2018A\u2019 has joined in a conspiracy to wage waragainst the Queen\u201d of the words, \u201c \u2018A\u2019 has joined in aconspiracy to wage war against the Republic\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      448.73,
      401.82,
      471.35
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 37 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      482.33,
      401.9,
      616.91
    ],
